                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Style for Every Day</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Discover versatile fashion for work, weekends, and every occasion in between</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Everyday Style, Made Easy</h2>\n<p>Find the pieces that make getting dressed feel effortless. From polished layers to relaxed essentials, our collections bring together contemporary style and comfort for women and men.</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Versatile clothing for every part of life</li>\n    <li>Shoes and accessories to complete your look</li>\n    <li>Easy-to-style favourites for any occasion</li>\n</ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-teaser",
              "position": 2,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Find Your New Favourites</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><i>Discover thoughtful styles that take you from everyday plans to special occasions</i></p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 3,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Polished &amp; Put-Together</h3>\n<p>Build a workwear wardrobe with refined layers, versatile separates, and comfortable shoes designed to move with you throughout the day.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Relaxed &amp; Ready for Anything</h3>\n<p>Explore everyday essentials, standout occasion styles, and finishing accessories to make each look your own. Find fresh options for women and men.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "html",
              "position": 4,
              "slots": []
