                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Style for Every Day</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Discover versatile fashion for work, weekends and every occasion in between</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image-text",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Everyday Essentials</h2>\n<p>Build a wardrobe that works as hard as you do, with contemporary clothing, shoes and accessories designed for everyday wear. From easy layers to polished staples, find pieces that bring comfort and style together.</p>\n<p>Thoughtful fits and versatile designs make it easy to create looks you’ll reach for season after season.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image-text",
              "position": 2,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Make It Your Own</h2>\n<p>Bring your look together with pieces that feel unmistakably you. Pair modern wardrobe staples with standout styles to create fresh combinations for any day.</p>\n<p>From a polished office outfit to a relaxed weekend look, discover fashion that moves with you.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "center-text",
              "position": 3,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "center",
                  "textContent": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">A Look for Every Moment</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Explore versatile clothing, shoes and accessories for the moments that make up your day, from effortless everyday style to special occasions.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image-text-bubble",
              "position": 4,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left-text",
                  "textContent": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Polished Layers</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Find refined clothing that brings an easy sense of polish to workdays and beyond.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "center-text",
                  "textContent": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Everyday Comfort</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Discover dependable essentials and comfortable shoes made for your daily routine.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right-text",
                  "textContent": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Standout Details</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Finish your look with accessories and occasion-ready styles that make an impression.</p>"
                }
              ]
