              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "center",
                  "textContent": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Find Your New Favorites</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; color: #666;\">Explore clothing and accessories in thoughtfully curated collections. Pair timeless wardrobe staples with fresh seasonal pieces for effortless looks from morning to evening.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 3,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Clothing & Accessories</h3>\n<p>Build a wardrobe that works for every part of life:</p>\n<ul style=\"color: #666;\">\n    <li>Polished workwear and everyday essentials</li>\n    <li>Contemporary styles for women and men</li>\n    <li>Accessories to finish your look</li>\n</ul>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Shoes for Every Occasion</h3>\n<p>Step into versatile styles made for everyday plans and special moments:</p>\n<ul style=\"color: #666;\">\n    <li>Comfortable shoes for daily wear</li>\n    <li>Smart styles for work and events</li>\n    <li>Finishing touches for every outfit</li>\n</ul>"
                }
