              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 2.5em; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Style for Every Day</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 1.2em; color: #666; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">Discover contemporary clothing, shoes and accessories for work, weekends and every occasion in between.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Build Your Look</h2>\n<p>Explore fashion essentials and standout pieces designed to make getting dressed feel effortless:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Clothing</strong> - Polished workwear and everyday staples</li>\n<li><strong>Shoes</strong> - Comfortable styles for every occasion</li>\n<li><strong>Accessories</strong> - Finishing touches for any outfit</li>\n<li><strong>Women’s Fashion</strong> - Versatile looks from casual to refined</li>\n<li><strong>Men’s Fashion</strong> - Modern essentials and sharp statement pieces</li>\n<li><strong>Occasionwear</strong> - Memorable styles for special moments</li>\n</ul>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Find Your Fit</h2>\n<p>Discover versatile fashion in a range of styles and fits, made to suit your wardrobe:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Everyday Essentials</strong> - Easy-to-wear pieces for daily life</li>\n<li><strong>Workwear</strong> - Refined styles for a polished look</li>\n<li><strong>Statement Styles</strong> - Standout pieces for special occasions</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 16px; color: #666;\">Browse each category to find clothing, shoes and accessories for your next look.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
